---
source: crates/kuayle/tests/golden.rs
expression: stdout
---
Official command-line interface for Kuayle, the self-hosted issue tracker

Usage: kuayle [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  auth           
  whoami         
  workspaces     
  issues         
  comments       
  relations      
  labels         
  teams          Team actions: list teams, read a single team
  statuses       Statuses actions: list statuses for a team
  projects       Project actions: list projects, read a single project
  cycles         Cycle actions: list, read, burndown, velocity (read-only)
  templates      Template actions: full CRUD for issue templates
  views          View actions: list views, read a single view (read-only)
  members        Member actions: list workspace members (read-only)
  favorites      Favorite actions: list workspace favorites (read-only)
  notifications  Notification actions: list user notifications (read-only, user-scoped)
  assets         Asset actions: upload a file, download one by ID
  wiki           Team and project wiki pages: read, write, tree, history, restore
  registry       A wiki's daily registry: append entries, read the feed and overviews
  agent-tasks    Agent tasks: the queue, one task, its history and runs (read-only)
  workflows      Agent workflows and profiles (read-only)
  usage          Show command reference
  completion     Generate shell completion script
  self-update    Check for updates or update the binary
  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>      [env: KUAYLE_PROFILE=]
      --url <URL>              [env: KUAYLE_URL=]
      --workspace <WORKSPACE>  [env: KUAYLE_WORKSPACE=]
      --format <FORMAT>        [default: auto]
      --no-cache               Disable resolve disk cache [env: KUAYLE_NO_CACHE=]
  -h, --help                   Print help
  -V, --version                Print version
